# API keys and other local settings. Copy .env.example to .env.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Rendered by `npm run icon`
assets/icon/icon.iconset/

# Some global gitignores exclude agent instruction files; this repo ships AGENTS.md and .agents/ on purpose
!AGENTS.md
!.agents/
